1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,717
Good afternoon, and
thank you for listening to this

2
00:00:02,741 --> 00:00:05,632
announcement about the
new play area at Riverside Park.

3
00:00:05,984 --> 00:00:10,160
The play area is suitable for any
child from 2 up to 12 years old.

4
00:00:10,464 --> 00:00:13,180
Older children are welcome
to use the skate park next door.

5
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:16,556
The old tarmac is gone, and
the ground is now covered

6
00:00:16,580 --> 00:00:19,212
in soft rubber, so falls
are much less painful.

7
00:00:19,585 --> 00:00:22,860
There are three slides, the
highest of which reaches 3 meters.

8
00:00:23,410 --> 00:00:25,639
For grown-ups, there are
new benches all around the

9
00:00:25,663 --> 00:00:27,992
edge, so you can sit and
keep an eye on the children.

10
00:00:28,380 --> 00:00:30,984
The whole area is fenced,
and the gate is a locking

11
00:00:31,008 --> 00:00:33,472
one, so little ones can't
slip out on their own.

12
00:00:33,765 --> 00:00:36,140
Toddlers have their own
sandpit in the shady corner.

13
00:00:36,520 --> 00:00:39,080
Please use the litter bins,
which you'll find around the area.

14
00:00:39,445 --> 00:00:42,069
In the winter months,
the lights stay on until 8 p.

15
00:00:42,093 --> 00:00:44,332
m., so families can
still play after school.

16
00:00:44,625 --> 00:00:46,580
You may notice CCTV cameras.

17
00:00:47,039 --> 00:00:50,420
They have been put up purely for
safety, to give everyone peace of mind.

18
00:00:50,740 --> 00:00:53,289
The official opening was
planned for April, but it has

19
00:00:53,313 --> 00:00:56,112
been moved to May, with
entertainment for the whole family.

20
00:00:56,449 --> 00:00:58,934
The mural on the back wall
was designed by children

21
00:00:58,958 --> 00:01:01,552
from local schools, who
were invited to submit ideas.

22
00:01:01,865 --> 00:01:03,932
Most of the money
came from the city council,

23
00:01:03,956 --> 00:01:05,852
with the rest raised
by local businesses.

24
00:01:06,359 --> 00:01:08,420
There's also a new water
fountain near the entrance.

25
00:01:08,920 --> 00:01:11,703
The area opens at 8
and now closes at 7 p.m.

26
00:01:11,727 --> 00:01:14,332
every day, rather
than at dusk as before.

27
00:01:14,714 --> 00:01:17,620
Dogs are welcome in the
park, but not inside the fence.

28
00:01:17,621 --> 00:01:21,120
For wheelchair users, we've
installed a specially designed swing.

29
00:01:21,540 --> 00:01:24,921
The old play area wasn't removed
because of its age or the cost

30
00:01:24,945 --> 00:01:28,392
of repairs, but because of safety
concerns raised by inspectors.

31
00:01:28,634 --> 00:01:30,919
Local volunteers helped
to plant new trees around

32
00:01:30,943 --> 00:01:33,052
the area, which will
give shade as they grow.

33
00:01:33,394 --> 00:01:35,224
If you'd like to
comment, please use the

34
00:01:35,248 --> 00:01:37,412
council website rather
than phoning the office.

35
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:40,346
The project was expected
to take three months, but

36
00:01:40,370 --> 00:01:43,032
in the end, it took six
months from start to finish.

37
00:01:43,379 --> 00:01:46,120
Thank you for listening, and we
hope to see your family there soon.

